Unreleased
==========

- License is now GPL-3.0-or-later
- GNOME app layout, translatable, symbolic icon
- Sonogram by default; mouse wheel zooms, middle drag pans

Woodshed 0.1
============

First version.

- Record any app's audio, the whole system or a microphone
- Waveform and sonogram with piano keys; tuning detection
- Seamless loops; slow down without changing pitch
- Transpose by semitones or cents; match a record to A440
- Plays and pauses the source app (MPRIS)
- Takes saved as FLAC with their settings
